    "    \"# I was unsure about the celltypes for obstetric and prenatal difficulties so I am ignoring it for now.\\n\",\n",
    "    \"# in the same manner I am ignoring endometriosis and primary infertility since there are no matching hybrid celltypes.\\n\",\n",
