    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"#### Note: log OR above 0.0 in this context means that ASE genes (within the threshold) have a higher chnace of being disease associated than the chance of nonASE genes to be disease associated. Similarily, log OR below 0.0 means that ASE genes (within the threshold) have a higher chance of being non-disease related in comparison to the chance of nonASE genes to be nondisease related (lower chance of ASE genes to be disease related in comparison to nonASE genes)\"\n",
